    contentHtml: "<p>Just wanted to inform you that I have completed Gloria safely at 5:34. Indeed I have raced better than I have thought although the bike course was bit hard.<br />\nSwimming 30:28<br />\nBike 2:57<br />\nRun 1:56<br />\nTransition times were longer around 9 min L Recovery was good after the race as well.</p>\n<p>Although we did not train together during the second half of the year I have used your previous training regimes L Thanks for everything, indeed working with you was very beneficiary for me and could say that start to like triathlon more J</p>\n<p>Now, I will take some time to rest and then will decide what to do for the next year.</p>",
